{"test_cases_lookup_map": {"{\"actual_output\": \"The annual milestone benefit unlocks **within 48 hours after you hit the annual spend milestone** (i.e., after you have spent Rs.\\u202f7,50,000 in the card\\u2019s anniversary year).\", \"context\": null, \"expected_output\": \"The benefit unlocks within 48 hours after the cardholder achieves the required spending milestone.\", \"hyperparameters\": null, \"input\": \"When does the annual milestone benefit unlock?\", \"retrieval_context\": [\"Redemption of Milestone benefits through SmartBuy By using your Regalia Gold credit card, you can avail the following milestone benefits: Premium Welcome Benefits Premium Voucher Benefits (Quarterly Milestone) Annual Milestone Benefits \\u2013 I Annual Milestone Benefits \\u2013 II Additionally, you can also resend your milestone vouchers. Webpage link: https://offers.reward360.in/milestone/regaliagold/milestone TnC for milestone benefits: https://www.hdfcbank.com/content/bbp/repositories/723fb80a-2dde-42a3- 9793-7ae1be57c87f/?path=/Personal/Pay/Cards/Credit Card/Credit Card Landing Page/Credit Cards/Super Premium/Regalia Gold Credit Card/RG-T-and-Cs-PDF.pdf *Note- Benefits will be unlocked within 48 hours on achievement of annual spends milestone You can hover your cursor on each milestone to check how much you have to spend to avail the benefit.\", \"Redemption of Milestone benefits through SmartBuy By using your Regalia Gold credit card, you can avail the following milestone benefits: Premium Welcome Benefits Premium Voucher Benefits (Quarterly Milestone) Annual Milestone Benefits \\u2013 I Annual Milestone Benefits \\u2013 II Additionally, you can also resend your milestone vouchers. Webpage link: https://offers.reward360.in/milestone/regaliagold/milestone TnC for milestone benefits: https://www.hdfcbank.com/content/bbp/repositories/723fb80a-2dde-42a3- 9793-7ae1be57c87f/?path=/Personal/Pay/Cards/Credit Card/Credit Card Landing Page/Credit Cards/Super Premium/Regalia Gold Cre